        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "After making me pay for the job completely upfront, they explained to me that they could respect my short delay times, in the end, they were five days late and the quality of the product was lackluster, arguably I could have done better painted aluminum in my own garage. Assembly was all crooked, refused to refund me, stay far away.",
